Changes made here:
- Converted from GO-sounds.md's Markdown table to tab-separated values
  (name, category code, MSB, LSB, program), by tools/import-sounds.
- Leading zeros removed from the numbers.
- One row left out: "GO Grand" (PNO, MSB 0, LSB 68, PC 1), because no bank
  on the GO:KEYS has MSB 0.
